    delphi:hasConfidence "0.85"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "All-or-none conversion and emergence of partial animals have direct criteria, while held-out interventions provide genuine discrimination. Public summaries permit checking the pattern but may not support a complete independent model audit." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Score within-animal melanocyte conversion continuously across perturbations, fit the published signaling model to cohort incidence, and test its preregistered partial-conversion predictions against intervention outcomes." ;
